{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44857","headline":"冬晚与诸文士会太仆田卿宅 · 无可","name":"冬晚与诸文士会太仆田卿宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从容啓华馆，馔玉复烧兰。\n是岁兹旬尽，良宵几刻残。\n风回松竹动，人息斗牛寒。\n此後思良集，须期月再圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}